[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10441.429, "timestamp": "02:54:01", "text": "合理的解释。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10443.99, "timestamp": "02:54:03", "text": "莎拉遇到了斯科特。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10445.91, "timestamp": "02:54:05", "text": "莎拉和斯科特之间迅速产生了一种奇妙的化学反应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10448.15, "timestamp": "02:54:08", "text": "关系。是的，你知道，我很感激"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10450.469, "timestamp": "02:54:10", "text": "你会支持我，但是，呃，也许你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10452.79, "timestamp": "02:54:12", "text": "姐姐说得对。不，或者不。有趣的。什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10456.23, "timestamp": "02:54:16", "text": "我会在意吗？ Jean 团队，宝贝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10459.269, "timestamp": "02:54:19", "text": "你之前是做什么的？嘿，我们关系还不错吗？你曾是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10461.11, "timestamp": "02:54:21", "text": "当时他有点咄咄逼人地向我袭来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10463.429, "timestamp": "02:54:23", "text": "那个论点。我只记得像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10465.75, "timestamp": "02:54:25", "text": "我们是兄妹，对吧？你们都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10468.07, "timestamp": "02:54:28", "text": "我现在已经离开了。而珍妮是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10469.59, "timestamp": "02:54:29", "text": "混蛋。可以睡在备用房间里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10472.55, "timestamp": "02:54:32", "text": "房间。哦，嗨，队里又来了一个女生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10474.71, "timestamp": "02:54:34", "text": "好的。我是认真的。我不是故意的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10476.71, "timestamp": "02:54:36", "text": "尖酸刻薄。看到这个真好。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10478.63, "timestamp": "02:54:38", "text": "是的。别太激动。我们不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10480.71, "timestamp": "02:54:40", "text": "即使是同一物种。你真是太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10482.63, "timestamp": "02:54:42", "text": "不过，加里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10484.389, "timestamp": "02:54:44", "text": "你为什么还没来？对不起，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10486.389, "timestamp": "02:54:46", "text": "又把你卷入了一场争论。我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10488.309, "timestamp": "02:54:48", "text": "顺便一提，你还要见见Twig。我真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10490.309, "timestamp": "02:54:50", "text": "我觉得你会喜欢他。他真是个好人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10492.71, "timestamp": "02:54:52", "text": "对我而言，并且会。他让我感觉……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10494.79, "timestamp": "02:54:54", "text": "尽管他的身体状况略显正常，但他的身体……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10496.63, "timestamp": "02:54:56", "text": "我完全无法理解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10498.309, "timestamp": "02:54:58", "text": "他一直想带我去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10499.99, "timestamp": "02:54:59", "text": "不提供任何服务的餐厅"}]